{"id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf.md","title":"Definition — Matching Families and Separated Presheaves","display":"Definition — Matching Families and Separated Presheaves","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","aliases":["14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf"],"display":"Definition — Matching Families and Separated Presheaves","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-small-site]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Matching Families and Separated Presheaves"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上的筛。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to C\">\\(f:D\\to C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:E\\to D\">\\(g:E\\to D\\)</span> 总是可复合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{f\\in S}F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\\n(\\mathrm{cod}(g)=\\mathrm{dom}(f)\\to F(g)(x_f)=x_{f\\circ g})\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall s,t\\in F(C)\\\n\\left(\\forall f\\in S\\ (F(f)(s)=F(f)(t))\\to s=t\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{f\\in S}F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\\n(\\mathrm{cod}(g)=\\mathrm{dom}(f)\\to F(g)(x_f)=x_{f\\circ g})\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall s,t\\in F(C)\\\n\\left(\\forall f\\in S\\ (F(f)(s)=F(f)(t))\\to s=t\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.4–III.5。筛的前合成封闭性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ g\\in S\">\\(f\\circ g\\in S\\)</span>，从而每个分量都有定义。分离性仅要求粘合唯一，不要求存在；它是 plus 构造分两步完成层化的中间性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"g:E\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\coloneqq\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{f\\in S}F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\\n(\\mathrm{cod}(g)=\\mathrm{dom}(f)\\to F(g)(x_f)=x_{f\\circ g})\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSeparatedOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsPresheaf}(F,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall s,t\\in F(C)\\\n\\left(\\forall f\\in S\\ (F(f)(s)=F(f)(t))\\to s=t\\right).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\circ g\\in S","display":false}],"bytes":1383,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf|Definition — Matching Families and Separated Presheaves]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]"},{"id":"365bea28fb7d89a0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]"},{"id":"e213602dd9109075","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点（[[14-df-small-site]]）。$F$ 为候选预层；$\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)$ 是 [[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]] 定义的相容族集合。满子范畴见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf|Definition — Matching Families and Separated Presheaves]]"},{"id":"5f5c83c7517a2504","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3c2e7637f8c4eeac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","5036bba7ca747e71"]}